  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level, the bravo can expend his martial focus as a free action and expend any amount from his dodge pool to gain half as much miss chance from his cunning celerity ability until the beginning of his next turn (for example, he could gain a 50% miss chance by spending 100% from his dodge pool).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
